+    Rule:
+    - Recover the corridor as the intersection of the two paths' one-step 8-neighborhood dilations, excluding the path cells themselves.
+    - The opening whose chessboard-distance profile to the marbles is lexicographically smaller is the entrance; the other opening is the exit.
